    "en": "Battle Cats complete guide—wave mechanics, cat coin investment priorities, and True Form evolution planning.",
    "ja": "にゃんこ大戦争完全攻略。ウェーブメカニクス、ネコカン投資優先度、真形進化計画を解説。"
